  "steps": [
   "Brown the beef in the oil over high heat for 4 minutes. Remove.",
   "Cook the onion and garlic for 6 minutes. Add the paprika.",
   "Add the tomato, oregano and salt and cook 10 minutes.",
   "Add the corn and beef and cook 8 minutes more.",
   "Finish with the basil."
